/// [Servicing] A CRM case that continues a conversation with a human relationship manager: stage, priority, sentiment, SLA, owning RM, journey and products discussed. Legacy release only. Cases belong to ReleaseId retail4-v1. Contoso extension entity: no CDM profile entity, BIAN status unmapped. Star role: fact; grain: one CRM case. Lakehouse: fact_crm_case <- silver_crm_case <- bank/crm-cases.json.
entity CrmCase
	lineageTag: f5724a44-334f-59e4-aab6-bc59a3442a5c
	backingTable: CrmCase
	keyProperty: CaseId

